1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:02,131
Manusia purba di Flores...

2
00:00:02,131 --> 00:00:04,434
ternyata makan sisa buruan komodo.

3
00:00:04,434 --> 00:00:06,765
Namanya Homo floresiensis,

4
00:00:06,765 --> 00:00:08,601
tingginya cuma 1 meter.

5
00:00:08,601 --> 00:00:11,075
Dulu ia dikira pemburu gajah purba.

6
00:00:11,075 --> 00:00:13,853
Tapi tulang-tulang gajah
di gua Liang Bua...

7
00:00:13,853 --> 00:00:14,862
bercerita lain.

8
00:00:14,862 --> 00:00:18,049
Gigitan komodo ada di
bagian paling berdaging.

9
00:00:18,049 --> 00:00:19,505
Goresan alat batu hobbit?

10
00:00:19,505 --> 00:00:21,151
Kebanyakan di tulang sisa.

11
00:00:21,151 --> 00:00:22,160
Hari ini,

12
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,693
hobbit sudah punah...

13
00:00:23,693 --> 00:00:25,823
tapi komodonya masih ada!

14
00:00:25,823 --> 00:00:28,325
Kamu berani rebutan makanan sama komodo?

15
00:00:28,325 --> 00:00:29,967
Jawab di komentar!
